        <mxCell id="4C6fnufZI3ALLGgQdooV-75" parent="4C6fnufZI3ALLGgQdooV-74" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;container=1;collapsible=0;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=12;fontColor=#0F172A;verticalAlign=middle;align=left;spacingLeft=62;spacingRight=8;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#64748B;strokeWidth=1.5;" value="&lt;b&gt;Aurora PostgreSQL&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748B&quot; style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;carts · orders · price + discount lines · status · POS ticket&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748B&quot; style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;outbox · processed_event · history&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="68" width="468" x="16" y="44" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="4C6fnufZI3ALLGgQdooV-76" parent="4C6fnufZI3ALLGgQdooV-75" style="shape=image;html=1;imageAspect=0;aspect=fixed;selectable=0;image=data:image/svg+xml," vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="30" width="30" x="16" y="19" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="4C6fnufZI3ALLGgQdooV-77" parent="4C6fnufZI3ALLGgQdooV-74" style="text;fontFamily=Arial;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#64748B;" value="The status row is the saga. There is no workflow engine and no internal topic for the POS call." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="56" width="468" x="16" y="128" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="4C6fnufZI3ALLGgQdooV-78" parent="1" style="swimlane;startSize=32;rounded=1;arcSize=8;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;container=1;collapsible=0;pointerEvents=0;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#0F172A;horizontal=1;align=left;spacingLeft=14;fillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeColor=#64748B;" value="Decisions · why this, and what it costs" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="400" width="688" x="1396" y="1518" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="4C6fnufZI3ALLGgQdooV-79" parent="4C6fnufZI3ALLGgQdooV-78" style="text;fontFamily=Arial;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#0F172A;" value="• &lt;b&gt;PlaceOrder is gRPC.&lt;/b&gt; The shopper is waiting for authorize_url. An order command topic on that path only adds a hop.&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;One command topic.&lt;/b&gt; Create, replace, cancel, and POS status share a key, so they cannot pass each other.&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;POS is a worker.&lt;/b&gt; The BSL call is gRPC from this app. A topic that only this app consumes is a queue in disguise.&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;One lifecycle topic.&lt;/b&gt; Delivery, Notification, Loyalty, Voucher &amp; Campaign, and the partner-adapter read order.events.&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Cart is lines, not prices.&lt;/b&gt; Priced live on every read; checkout rejects a total the shopper did not see. Cost: a Catalog call per cart view (P-31, P-32).&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Deals priced at the cart, held at checkout (draft, O-21).&lt;/b&gt; EvaluateBasket after PriceLines on every read. PlaceOrder holds the redemption with ReserveRedemptions; Campaign commits on order.events{placed} and releases on cancelled or rejected, so a limited deal is never used twice. Cost: a Campaign call per cart view and a fifth sync dependency at checkout.&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Live store check.&lt;/b&gt; ResolveStore at PlaceOrder, no store copy. Cost: checkout fails if Brand &amp; Store is down.&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Live delivery quote.&lt;/b&gt; PlaceOrder carries quote_id and Order calls GetQuote. Cost: a fourth sync dependency (P-22).&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Sweeper, not a timer service.&lt;/b&gt; Cost: a timeout is as precise as the cron interval.&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;BSL only for now.&lt;/b&gt; Promise and VIVI ship when a brand needs them." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="266" width="608" x="16" y="44" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="4C6fnufZI3ALLGgQdooV-80" parent="4C6fnufZI3ALLGgQdooV-78" style="text;fontFamily=Arial;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#64748B;" value="ponytail: saga state is the Postgres status. Ceiling: retry resumes at the last commit. Upgrade path is Temporal or Cadence if a step needs a durable timer." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="56" width="608" x="16" y="320" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="4C6fnufZI3ALLGgQdooV-81" parent="1" style="swimlane;startSize=32;rounded=1;arcSize=8;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;container=1;collapsible=0;pointerEvents=0;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#0F172A;horizontal=1;align=left;spacingLeft=14;fillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeColor=#94A3B8;" value="Not this domain" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="400" width="772" x="2148" y="1518" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="4C6fnufZI3ALLGgQdooV-82" parent="4C6fnufZI3ALLGgQdooV-81" style="text;fontFamily=Arial;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#0F172A;" value="&lt;b&gt;Catalog&lt;/b&gt; — price. Order calls PriceLines and stores the price lines it was given.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Payment&lt;/b&gt; — the charge, the capture, the refund. Order asks, then waits on payment.events.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Brand &amp; Store&lt;/b&gt; — hours, zone, hidden. Order calls ResolveStore at PlaceOrder and keeps no copy.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Delivery&lt;/b&gt; — fleet, ETA, and the fee. Order reads the fee with GetQuote. Delivery starts on order.events{accepted} and reports back on delivery.events.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Voucher &amp; Campaign&lt;/b&gt; — deals, coupons, stacking, and budgets. Order calls EvaluateBasket and ReserveRedemptions and stores the allocations it was given. Campaign commits or releases from order.events.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Identity&lt;/b&gt; — the shopper. Order stores the id it was given." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="240" width="724" x="16" y="44" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="4C6fnufZI3ALLGgQdooV-83" parent="1" style="text;fontFamily=Arial;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#0F172A;" value="&lt;b&gt;Contract&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#854D0E&quot; style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;GetCart and UpdateCart are gRPC; a cart is never on the bus. PlaceOrder checks out the cart, carries quote_id, and holds the deals with ReserveRedemptions. order.requested is the aggregator and the POS status. order.events is the lifecycle; placed leaves only after authorized, and a wallet order has no redirect. Capture and void are payment.requested, which Payment owns. delivery.events closes a delivery order. The POS call is a worker.&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="48" width="1412" x="1396" y="1426" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="4C6fnufZI3ALLGgQdooV-84" parent="1" style="text;fontFamily=Arial;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#64748B;" value="A redelivery of the same version is a no-op. A crash before Ack retries from the last committed status. The shopper path has no Ack." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="28" width="1412" x="1396" y="1478" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="4C6fnufZI3ALLGgQdooV-85" edge="1" parent="1" source="4C6fnufZI3ALLGgQdooV-61" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;endArrow=blockThin;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=10;fontFamily=Arial;fontStyle=1;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#059669;fontColor=#059669;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;jumpStyle=arc;jumpSize=8;" target="4C6fnufZI3ALLGgQdooV-62">
